   "id": "g73u8u",
   "title": "如果黄仁勋再创业",
   "url": "https://www.huxiu.com/article/4905596.html",
   "summary": "<figure><img src=\"https://img.huxiucdn.com/ai/ai-general-cover/202611/14/43159-prod-gptep-general-1-1794638903318.png?imageView2/1/w/1440/h/810/|imageMogr2/strip/interlace/1/quality/85/format/png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></figure>黄仁勋辞职的消息还没有满24小时，一大批满怀爱意的“小作文”就冒出来了。英伟达内部一篇要求董事会听取员工意见的帖子，收到了超过16",
